==German==
===Etymology===
Originally “the person that strips the [[hide]] (back then called ''[[Decke]]'') from a perished animal”.

===Noun===
'''Abdecker''' {{m}} ({{plural}} Abdecker)
# [[knacker]] (one who deals with animal cadavers)

